{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>羅志祥（小豬）《2026羅志祥30th巡迴演唱會香港站》今晚（13日）假紅館舉行，一登場即勁歌熱舞，連唱《Show’s Ｗorld》、《全城熱愛》、《舞魂再現》等快歌，炒熱全場氣氛。身為小豬忠粉的姜濤，小時候就因為偶像專登為自己改英文名叫「Show」，而2023年姜濤開騷就曾邀請小豬擔任嘉賓，今次輪到小豬在港開騷，亦順理成章請姜濤做嘉賓。</p><figure><img alt=\"羅志祥（小豬）《2026羅志祥30th巡迴演唱會香港站》今晚（13日）假紅館舉行。（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142598910485729280032647.jpeg/IH3RAfUF9g8DVMCXpDsxHylHA9I1O3X0pFJTdZFSU3U\"/><figcaption>羅志祥（小豬）《2026羅志祥30th巡迴演唱會香港站》今晚（13日）假紅館舉行。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勁歌熱舞。（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142598913170214912027431.jpeg/1JLCfDpifxPMT84p-WHNIkncEDpLyDCmjlf4wbtX-ME\"/><figcaption>勁歌熱舞。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"超親民。（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599253248446464123607.jpeg/7bC5KAxt1nnx918uGrc3_0vERM4ha5HVbfWJYVj1iWE\"/><figcaption>超親民。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142601519401537536872403.jpeg/auPtzKxOkMVlUr3ycywErYYL_KchSHTprFjeLZlY3i0\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599256058761216509123.jpeg/XeWrm6mg3QSAbU1ILdNQGfAyEiDqPrZzRNLAbnHSwG4\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599258957156352496305.jpeg/xudykRPXBI0WWhY-0JrMTFnBPZTYgNPoFvBF5CPwReQ\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599261515812864218075.jpeg/2P3XN6Q7wvgVais-yVpwQfwFEMnrdThKZT4F8FA-BfA\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><p>姜濤出場方式非常有心思，小豬先在台下彈上台，一開始扮站不穩在地上打滾，之後再彈出來就變了姜濤。姜濤配合小豬同穿皮褸，全黑造型帥氣十足，他獻唱國語歌《撐腰》《白果》，唱完歌二人攬實準備落台之際，小豬突襲式錫了姜濤小嘴一啖，姜濤即尷尬笑用手掩住小嘴，小豬亦扮姜濤齊掩嘴，非常搞笑，掀起高潮，令歌迷瘋狂尖叫！</p><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142601646090620928342158.jpeg/H7zcfebzPs6ytc64Rwmq3Dc-a72ckvlsvhBOYYQQTmE\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142601648754135040813054.jpeg/JGoRZP5OPzxjBX7u4g7K5t6wA42MbBRj6IuGidKLhok\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142601643615850496123879.jpeg/IxturZS7NF9fnxbsjN2lxhhlNxJdQ1PqTmTL3HRky9w\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599453505490944314258.jpeg/NR1yw07kdMjE-x2Ur_gDCBMI9CH5OZ0czclmzfjJZs0\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142601794535297024653908.jpeg/ycp1NMJVywURkLWtO_mdgtrMmpfbvrXraUp1M1NKdTM\"/><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599031227158528943857.jpeg/RfFg4J1MEuKw0NuGVTAT8ihkJSeVKoBK-AZpFM0GaRQ\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599033458659328863571.jpeg/ZrfeoFOWntq4lWct8AUi3dUYhAHBrvsdQ0EXjHZBF4w\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599035719520256159238.jpeg/LfQqzoDK5WSlKrNSkCVWBhUVMnZTpwLMsiQ7U4ckO1M\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142601891138506752293108.jpeg/XXZhWagNq28VjCjgrLLvkAYLZf9xNiIp9ks-lcNLPpU\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142601893680386048637451.jpeg/FuphdmdW3Qd5OZqvtFqM_C9IgEdGu3sMhXbQHLB20Bw\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142601896360677376619257.jpeg/agstpqZzty0n7kJtRyxHMPYBKHXzuf2xbZ2LkVidi5E\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599363399258112352416.jpeg/eWnuMUiUjNZjKlPFj05-HJjFrlI-Th9bnD585Lk-fOQ\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599365936943104016843.jpeg/F7VVSdUFXDhCEyiuYjkM1CleJo785XvwhOFcv6HhXL8\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599368323633152165724.jpeg/-_j5HJbH7jqqmLm1lRa5dK62R0f6V7FB8gGr2tcBq9o\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599371058450432527096.jpeg/vKhE_KL8pHu98aHiWsFKOFZCokjbichCTkZSbGtGUmw\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142601989151264768456897.jpeg/Mmd6LV4zdUNAJE9DAyTwniIbZ9TrKbvIiX_4K7x_-Cs\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142601986546470912501829.jpeg/rr5wyCCPVLM4r7BjMOAVrnP-QiFJrVLcf2UqpEplKqQ\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142601983916511232059287.jpeg/5X7IdmqSlvQGgm53wlhNvK0Omy2zxDfjzY9RYviPUWI\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-13T15:19:29.544998+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":564,"images":25,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}